direction: down
change: Prompt change
golden: Golden set 30-50 cases
asserts: Code asserts
judge: Calibrated LLM judge
pairwise: Pairwise vs current prompt
gate: Merge gate
prod: Production traffic
sample: Weekly trace sample
change -> golden: run every case x3
golden -> asserts: regex, schema, length
asserts -> judge: only what code cannot check
judge -> pairwise: candidate vs baseline
pairwise -> gate: wins or ties
gate -> prod: deploy
prod -> sample: 20 traces per week
sample -> golden: add the weird ones
